(919,26,48,'Searching algorithms',NULL),
(920,26,49,'Sorting algorithms intro','**Selection sort** finds the smallest item and moves it to the front, then repeats for the rest.\n\nExample 1:\n```\n<?php\n$v = [5, 2, 9, 1];\n$n = count($v);\nfor ($i = 0; $i < $n - 1; $i++) {\n    $small = $i;\n    for ($j = $i + 1; $j < $n; $j++) {\n        if ($v[$j] < $v[$small]) {\n            $small = $j;\n        }\n    }\n    $t = $v[$i];\n    $v[$i] = $v[$small];\n    $v[$small] = $t;\n}\nforeach ($v as $x) {\n    echo ($x) . PHP_EOL;\n}\n```\nOutput:\n```\n1\n2\n5\n9\n```\n\nExample 2:\n```\n<?php\n$v = [30, 10, 20];\n$n = count($v);\nfor ($i = 0; $i < $n - 1; $i++) {\n    $small = $i;\n    for ($j = $i + 1; $j < $n; $j++) {\n        if ($v[$j] < $v[$small]) {\n            $small = $j;\n        }\n    }\n    $t = $v[$i];\n    $v[$i] = $v[$small];\n    $v[$small] = $t;\n}\necho ($v[0]) . (" ") . ($v[1]) . (" ") . ($v[2]) . PHP_EOL;\n```\nOutput:\n```\n10 20 30\n```\n\nExample 3:\n```\n<?php\n$v = [9, 2, 4, 1];\n$n = count($v);\nfor ($i = 0; $i < $n - 1; $i++) {\n    $small = $i;\n    for ($j = $i + 1; $j < $n; $j++) {\n        if ($v[$j] < $v[$small]) {\n            $small = $j;\n        }\n    }\n    $t = $v[$i];\n    $v[$i] = $v[$small];\n    $v[$small] = $t;\n}\nforeach ($v as $x) {\n    echo ($x) . PHP_EOL;\n}\n```\nOutput:\n```\n1\n2\n4\n9\n```\n\nPractice: change the numbers or words in Example 1, then guess the new output before you run it.'),
(921,26,50,'Mini project','A small **grade book**: add up the scores, find the average and count how many students **passed**.\n\nExample 1:\n```\n<?php\n$scores = [70, 85, 90, 65];\n$sum = 0;\n$pass = 0;\nforeach ($scores as $s) {\n    $sum += $s;\n    if ($s >= 70) {\n        $pass++;\n    }\n}\necho ("Average: ") . (intdiv($sum, count($scores))) . PHP_EOL;\necho ("Passed: ") . ($pass) . PHP_EOL;\n```\nOutput:\n```\nAverage: 77\nPassed: 3\n```\n\nExample 2:\n```\n<?php\n$v = [4, 9, 6];\n$big = $v[0];\n$total = 0;\nforeach ($v as $x) {\n    $total += $x;\n    if ($x > $big) {\n        $big = $x;\n    }\n}\necho ("Total: ") . ($total) . PHP_EOL;\necho ("Largest: ") . ($big) . PHP_EOL;\n```\nOutput:\n```\nTotal: 19\nLargest: 9\n```\n\nExample 3:\n```\n<?php\n$scores = [6, 4, 8, 9];\n$sum = 0;\n$pass = 0;\nforeach ($scores as $s) {\n    $sum += $s;\n    if ($s >= 6) {\n        $pass++;\n    }\n}\necho ("Average: ") . (intdiv($sum, count($scores))) . PHP_EOL;\necho ("Passed: ") . ($pass) . PHP_EOL;\n```\nOutput:\n```\nAverage: 6\nPassed: 3\n```\n\nPractice: change the numbers or words in Example 1, then guess the new output before you run it.'),
